   "solution": "<p><img src=\"media/12/12d0331ca5231cdc9f56.png\"></p>\n<p>&there4; Total number of ways = 1 + 11 + 45 + 84 + 70 + 21 + 1<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 233</p>"
