  {
   "n": 17,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>The maximum possible difference between the 4 digit numbers formed by using the 4 different&nbsp;digits 1, 2, 3, 5 is</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "<p>4086</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "<p>5076</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "<p>4386</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "<p>3242</p>"
    }
   ],
   "answer": [
    "A"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "A",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>Since 5321 is the largest number and 1235 is the least number that can be formed from the given&nbsp;4 digits, thus the maximum possible difference is 5321 &ndash; 1235 = 4086</p>"
  }
